MODULE: TypeOKDeletionOutsideDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: environment deletion corrupts the bounded head witness
PERTURBS: DeleteTree

--- FIND
    /\ ~deleted /\ deleted' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<leaf, free, cold, hold, head, appended, timely, admitted, leadDone, rank>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the external deletion event installs an out-of-domain head.
    /\ ~deleted /\ deleted' = TRUE /\ head' = Cardinality(Leaves) + 2
    /\ UNCHANGED <<leaf, free, cold, hold, appended, timely, admitted, leadDone, rank>>
--- END
